[Name] libwacom
[Summary] Tablet input device library
[Description] libwacom is the library for finding and describing Wacom and similar tablet devices. Mutter 48+ optionally links it for tablet-aware input routing. Build AFTER GLib 2.84 and BEFORE Mutter. The ISO doesn't ship it. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
